  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-0TO2-R4-037$qb$, $qb$A1-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A new tool removes a manual step you have used for years. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Learn the new flow and stop the old step once the new method is verified$qb$, $qb$Use the new tool while checking results against the old method at first$qb$, $qb$Keep the manual step as a permanent backup$qb$, $qb$Use the old method for important cases$qb$, $qb$Avoid the new tool until everyone else is comfortable$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
