  ($qb$HEAIL-ERC-MCQ-027$qb$, $qb$A1-04$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You have been passed over for something you wanted. What is the most useful next step?$qb$, $qb$Ask what would make the difference next time$qb$, $qb$Ask why the decision went the way it did$qb$, $qb$Take some time before doing anything about it$qb$, $qb$Tell your manager you are disappointed$qb$, $qb$Carry on as normal and say nothing about it$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
