  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-017$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your employer is introducing a new system next month. What is most useful to find out first?$qb$, $qb$What it is meant to do better than the current one$qb$, $qb$How much training will be provided$qb$, $qb$When exactly the change takes effect$qb$, $qb$Who decided to bring it in$qb$, $qb$Whether other teams have used it already$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
