  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-021$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A change was introduced three months ago and your team is still not using it properly. What is most useful to establish?$qb$, $qb$What the team is doing instead, and why$qb$, $qb$Whether the team had enough training$qb$, $qb$Whether the change is working elsewhere$qb$, $qb$How to get the team to follow it$qb$, $qb$Whether the change should be reversed$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
