  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-023$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A customer has asked for something your process does not allow for. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Find out what he needs and what the process is protecting$qb$, $qb$Explain that the process does not allow it$qb$, $qb$Ask your manager whether an exception is possible$qb$, $qb$Do it his way and mention it afterwards$qb$, $qb$Follow the process, since it exists for a reason$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-024$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You are told halfway through a task that the requirements have changed. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Find out what the change means for the work already done$qb$, $qb$Ask why the requirements changed at this point$qb$, $qb$Start again on the new requirements$qb$, $qb$Finish the current version first$qb$, $qb$Carry on and adjust it at the end$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
