  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-026$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A new manager has changed how your team reports its work. The change adds time and you cannot see the purpose. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Ask what the new report is being used for$qb$, $qb$Ask whether the extra time is worth what it produces$qb$, $qb$Do it as asked and see whether the purpose becomes clear$qb$, $qb$Do it in less detail so it takes less time$qb$, $qb$Point out that the old report was quicker$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
