  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-030$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your industry is changing in a way that will affect your job in a few years. What is most useful now?$qb$, $qb$Find out which parts of your work will change first$qb$, $qb$Start learning the skills that will be needed$qb$, $qb$Watch how the change develops before acting$qb$, $qb$Ask your employer what their plans are$qb$, $qb$Carry on, since a few years is a long time$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
