  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-033$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$What most reliably tells you whether a new way of working is better than the old one?$qb$, $qb$Comparing them on something that mattered before the change$qb$, $qb$Asking the people who use it every day$qb$, $qb$Measuring how long each one takes$qb$, $qb$Whether people prefer the new way$qb$, $qb$Whether the problems it was meant to fix have gone$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-MCQ-034$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your team has been asked to take on work from a department that is closing. What is most useful to establish first?$qb$, $qb$What the work actually involves and how much there is$qb$, $qb$Whether your team has the capacity for it$qb$, $qb$Who in your team will take it on$qb$, $qb$Whether extra staff will come with the work$qb$, $qb$How long the arrangement is expected to last$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
