  ($qb$HEAIL-ADP-SJT-037$qb$, $qb$A1-09$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You work in a bank branch. Head office has introduced a new customer check that adds four minutes to every account opening. Queues have grown and customers are complaining. How do you respond?$qb$, $qb$Record what the delay is doing to the queue and send that to head office$qb$, $qb$Raise the queue problem with your branch manager$qb$, $qb$Find out what the new check is meant to catch$qb$, $qb$Do the check more quickly so the queue moves$qb$, $qb$Skip the check when the branch is busy$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
