  ($qb$HEAIL-TMC-FIB-010$qb$, $qb$A1-06$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Agreeing who does what before starting prevents the argument about who should have ______.$qb$, $qb$done it$qb$, $qb$started it$qb$, $qb$attended$qb$, $qb$reported it$qb$, $qb$decided$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
